  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sindh-Multi-Sectoral Action for Nutrition (MSAN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to increase the dietary diversity and improve sanitation and hygiene practices in targeted project districts areas.The project will contribute to improving the underlying conditions leading to chronic malnutrition through 1.a sanitation intervention focusing on behavioral change to achieve open defecation-free villages; and 2. an agriculture intervention to introduce production of nutrition food for consumption through homestead gardening practices and increasing household knowledgeof food and nutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
